{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-61","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on the first bimedial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the second binomial.","book":10,"number":61,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":61,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","contentId":"euclid-10-61","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"856b4f48008521a077de5391b6cb972f7004e1dec4faa0729cc3aace9bb7283b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-61.statement","euclid-10-61.construction.1","euclid-10-61.construction.2","euclid-10-61.proof.1","euclid-10-61.proof.2","euclid-10-61.proof.3","euclid-10-61.proof.4","euclid-10-61.proof.5","euclid-10-61.proof.6","euclid-10-61.proof.7","euclid-10-61.proof.8","euclid-10-61.proof.9","euclid-10-61.proof.10","euclid-10-61.proof.11","euclid-10-61.proof.12","euclid-10-61.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-61.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa921c67d5fc885ab6ae039d24b8d78b22b46bd93e3ca2746afccc1be90e6e38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the first bimedial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the second binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"头双中项无理线段直线上的正方形直线适用于有理线段直线,以宽度为第二二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2797260fb672aec56c199ff51eb7b24800e46e49e2f7e370bf38f252736b18b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a first bimedial straight line divided into its medials at C, of which medials AC is the greater; let a rational straight line DE be set out, and let there be applied to DE the parallelogram DF equal to the square on AB, producing DG as its breadth; I say that DG is a second binominal straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把AB线分为第双中项无理线段直线,中间线为C,中间线为AC,中间线为AC;放出有理线段 DE,然后对DE平行四边形 DF,相当于AB正方形,宽度为DG;我说,DG是第二条双向直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9add3a184705b51e32056be969ccf2cfe377dc0ff37a09f00dc830e0c17c46a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the same construction as before be made."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"做以前一样的工程"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d252419fe67dcdffb89b8acb4d2e8cc4496fc2aa289aaf35bbc9a44d385783e0","citations":["euclid-10-37","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is a first bimedial divided at C, therefore AC, CB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only, and containing a rational rectangle, [[X. 37](/principles/euclid-10-37)] so that the squares on AC, CB are also medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是第一个双中项无理线段除以C,AC,CB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,有理,矩形,AC,正方形,AC也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 37](/principles/euclid-10-37)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e3fc5c667cae62cbc4146671666a40bd5b4cae643ff9f0c4ce9c0e0e9b235be","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DL is medial. [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以DL是中项无理线段 [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a34031630483b2aa7d55a68da4b888de2a028d6ab8e44a1edbd4f0b476660f4","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it has been applied to the rational straight line DE; therefore MD is rational and incommensurable in length with DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 DE;因此,MD为有理和不可公度为DE。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10e5b50cee5750ae28a8be37b30ed7ffe44d4a8ab3e0e83926d6a92432f9f310","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since twice the rectangle AC, CB is rational, MF is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AC的两倍,CB是有理,MF也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de43b675b867602a18104ae5b2b0ef1869356753c23e15bd438e507f7d3b875a","citations":["euclid-10-20","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line ML; therefore MG is also rational and commensurable in length with ML, that is, DE; [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] therefore DM is incommensurable in length with MG. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 ML;因此,MG也是有理和长度可公度,ML,即DE;因此,DM是不可公度,MG是MG。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f93458f7d0d708f2d2873b31ca376d00babe0149412168669d4ac52f879027c","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore DM, MG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore DG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,DM,MG,有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,DG,二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba644d5bfba5710b0263d1ad8919704ddaa98f3f62334aeee300c1d13b164777","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next to be proved that it is also a second binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步是证明它也是第二条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7afb838193d16cae7586dd13fa5d7c6fd2ec5d5ad03a9b3a575c261473d2daf0","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the squares on AC, CB are greater than twice the rectangle AC, CB, therefore DL is also greater than MF, so that DM is also greater than MG. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AC的正方形,CB是矩形的两倍,CB是CB,因此,DL也超过MF,DM也超过MG。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"606da6dcab9e56d99e8a4f7e34d7103cf649bc7f0c0dd5ffa5832cf4afbd3bc4","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on AC is commensurable with the square on CB, DH is also commensurable with KL, so that DK is also commensurable with KM. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC正方形可公度正方形CBCBDH可公度KLKLDK可公度KM [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fd07651280a38b77e2d52977c855e36908aa17633422d8b834d7faf7d825c14","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN; therefore the square on DM is greater than the square on MG by the square on a straight line commensurable with DM. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 DK KM等于MN的正方形;因此,DM的正方形比MG的正方形大于正方形,直线为可公度和DM。 [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"043512f052c6f81df47c4161de9f6a1fd0a71a6045bfc497eb2b3f250139c1a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And MG is commensurable is length with DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"MG是可公度是DE的长度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa03647889362002993011417f57c5753e5f5a63f8e1376bf1d2b75bbbaf71a5","citations":["euclid-10-def-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a second binomial straight line. [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是第二二项无理线段直线。 [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-61.source","contentId":"euclid-10-61","revisionId":"euclid-10-61@raw-856b4f48008521a0","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c4151928b01e09650acf5dbfef8efaf0a39ee1d89a6cd32460b15e97edf6c64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-61:euclid-10-37:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-61","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-61.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-37","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61/","sourceLabel":"X. 37"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-61:euclid-10-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-61","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-61.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.61/","sourceLabel":"X. 21"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-61:euclid-10-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-61","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-61.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","b